<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16416" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄσπορ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄσπαρτος, χώρα</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
				19.123
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				2.379.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Alex.</u>
				66
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PRyl.</u>
				133.22
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A. D.)</span>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of plants, <i>unsown, growing without cultivation,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Rh.Pr.</u>
				8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				74.58
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>begotten without impregnation,</i> of Hephaestus, <i><span class="en">
				Nonn.
				<u>D.</u>
				9.229
			</span></i>; but, <i>producing without impregnation,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰλύς</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				40.433
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<i>barren,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Am.</u>
				28
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nonn.
				<u>D.</u>
				2.221
			</span></i>, al.; <i>not having issue,</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				40.119
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				Act.
			, <i>preventing production,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐχμός</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				39.139
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
